TY  - GEN
ID  - ihe-iti-pcf-1-1-0
AU  - IHE IT Infrastructure Technical Committee
TI  - IHE IT Infrastructure Technical Framework Supplement — Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF)
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/08/04
PB  - Integrating the Healthcare Enterprise (IHE)
UR  - https://profiles.ihe.net/ITI/PCF/1.1.0/
LA  - en
AB  - The Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) Profile supports the use of a FHIR Consent resource to capture, discover, and enforce patient privacy consent directives across healthcare actors using the Access Consent [ITI-108] transaction and progressive Basic, Intermediate, and Advanced Consent profiles.
ER  - 

TY  - GEN
ID  - ihe-iti-vhl-1-0-0-comment
AU  - IHE IT Infrastructure Technical Committee
TI  - IHE IT Infrastructure Technical Framework Supplement — Verifiable Health Links (VHL)
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/06/14
PB  - Integrating the Healthcare Enterprise (IHE)
UR  - https://profiles.ihe.net/ITI/VHL/1.0.0-comment/
LA  - en
AB  - The Verifiable Health Links (VHL) Profile specifies actors (VHL Holder, VHL Sharer, VHL Receiver, Trust Anchor) and transactions ([ITI-YY1] Submit PKI Material with DID, [ITI-YY2] Retrieve Trust List with DID, [ITI-YY3] Generate VHL, [ITI-YY4] Provide VHL, [ITI-YY5] Retrieve Manifest) for issuing, presenting, verifying, and redeeming cryptographically verifiable links to health documents in a trust-anchor-neutral manner.
ER  - 
